	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. "Omittamus", inquis, "titulos" moxque eas ipsas literas "Praestantissimo", <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>viro scilicet, inscribis.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Plus satis diu ineptitum nunc est, facessant porro id genus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nugę; satis vero sit vel amici vel fratris nomine alterum ab altero insigniri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Praedicavit mihi magnopere tuam erga se hum<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>anitatem pius adolescens <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName>Iohannes Rhodolphus</persName>, qui metuo ut possit in demortui patris locum surrogar<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>i, cum propter alios competitores, tum vero maxime propter Mercatorem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>illum, qui celebriore familia ortus suffragiorum non pondere quidem, sed <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>numero tamen Rhodolphum vincet, quando <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eo iniquitatis delapsi sunt etiam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>qui evangelium profiteri videri volunt, ut personis potius quam ecclesiis consultum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>cupiant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego gratuito ministrarem illi ecclesię, quo afflicta vidua ęs alienum, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quo obstricta tenetur, dissolvere posset, si quid ista ratione proficerem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Verum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quid futurum sit nescio, nisi quod miris artibus quędam geruntur <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et difficile esse videam contra flumen niti.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nulli etiamnum demanda<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ta est eius ecclesię cura, sed alterius hic diaconi operam conduxerunt <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>usque ad divi Ioannis festum diem, hoc est tantisper, sic enim interpretantur <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>prudentiores, dum Mercator ille <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> in nonnullorum sese familiariter <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>insinuet sicque voti sui compos evadat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed dominus ipse viderit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Uff necht ist mir ain schreiben komen von ainem guͦten herren und <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>fründ;<note type="margin">dazu a.R.:... tzen tagen... mir ge-... h. <persName ref="p18250">Moritz</persName>... sein volck... und ver-... n sich... schlacht... eh diß... daruff... et gott... ain... stand sin.</note> der zögt mir an, das doctor <persName>Abraham Murgel</persName>, doctor <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName>Hans Murgels</persName> sun, zuͦ <placeName ref="l291">Lyndauw</placeName> den nechsten herauff von <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName>Mentz</placeName> kommen seye; der hab im glouplich und fuͤr gewiss gesagt, das <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>hertzog <persName ref="p18250">Moritz</persName> nidergelegen mitt grossem schaden und treffelich <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>guͦt edelleut verloren habe; es seye ouch hertzog <persName>Jörg von Mächel</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>mit ettlich andern gefangnen personen, die gantz fuͤrnem seyen, gen <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName>Madenburg</placeName> gefuͤrt worden.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Ach gott, das sy es erharren möchten!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Soll es <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>aber letstlich mitt inen umschlachen, wirdt man sovyl grausamer <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>mitt inen handlen, sovyl der vorgenden victorien mehr gewesen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Hilff gott vom himel und hab ain vätterlichs einsechen, mach unser boßhait <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>und undanckbarkait und demnach ouch der tyranney unserer find ain ort.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Mitt <placeName ref="l306">Mailand</placeName> acht es kainem guͦten gleich.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Der starck allain weyß got <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>welle uns doch ain mal mitt gnedigen ougen ansechen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Schero meo vide, per dominum obsecro, ne molestiam ullam exhibeas re<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ferendis gratiis; nam istuc meditari te ex literis tuis mihi subolet; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>abunde satis erit, si brevi epistolio dignatus virum fueris, quo intelligat <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>munusculum illud et te accepisse et tibi non fuisse ingratum; si quid... <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>addideris, sancte tibi affirmo illum non honore, sed magna abs te [ini<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>u]ria se affectum existimaturum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Bene vale cum tua domo, quam rogo mea <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>vice officiosissime salutes, non praeteritis omnibus fratribus, [a] <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>quibus cęlesti patri diligentissime commendari semper cupio.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">13. ianu[arii].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8055">A[mbro<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>sius] Bl[aurerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praeclaro Iesu Christi servo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>amico omnium longe charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
